msgctxt "OrchardCore.Users.Views.AuditTrailAdmin.Index"
msgid ""
"The properties of the <code>User</code> object are stored in the event's "
"\"User Snapshot\" property. If no option is selected, that property will not"
" be stored. The property is retained as text if the \"Store\" option is "
"selected. Otherwise, the selected service is used to redact its content. You"
" can learn more about data redaction <a href=\"{0}\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code>User</code> "
"对象的属性会存储在事件的“用户快照”属性中。如果未选择任何选项，则不会存储该属性。如果选择“存储”选项，该属性会作为文本保留；否则，将使用所选服务编辑其内容。您可以<a"
" href=\"{0}\">在此处</a>详细了解数据编辑。"

